<content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">Brooke was racing bikes with a friend on the way to the park. A table of her distance traveled over time is shown.</para>
<table>
  <tgroup cols="2"><caption>Brooke</caption>
  <thead>
    <row>
      <entry>Time (minutes)</entry>
      <entry>Distance (miles)</entry>
    </row>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <row>
      <entry>
        0
      </entry>
      <entry>
        0
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        5
      </entry>
      <entry>
        1.2
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        10
      </entry>
      <entry>
        2.4
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        15
      </entry>
      <entry>
        3.6
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        20
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4.8
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        25
      </entry>
      <entry>
        6.0
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody>
</tgroup></table>
<para>What was Brooke’s average rate of change between 5 minutes and 20 minutes? </para></section>
